    "conc_PrimaryPM25_L0": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "ug/m^3",
     "shape": [
      "rcv_cells"
     ],
     "description": "Per-receptor primary PM2.5 response from the emissions that reach layer 0: sum_s SR_PrimaryPM25_L0[s,rcv]*E_PM25_L0[s] (pre-fact). A PLAIN TWO-FACTOR product summed over one contracted index, one observed per (pathway, layer) — folding the three layers into a single aggregate would make the rewrite's matvec detector reject this body (it requires op `*` with exactly two args) and drop the pathway from the SR gate silently."
    },
